WEBVTT

00:00:01.114 --> 00:00:12.992
Yes, I embraced tenderness and devotion
sou itooshisa to kizuna wo daita

00:00:13.226 --> 00:00:18.799
Floating in unending space
hatenaki umi ni ukabu

00:00:18.799 --> 00:00:25.728
On this small planet
chiisa na hoshi de

00:00:26.173 --> 00:00:37.209
When I feel your warmth next to me
anata no nukumori wo soba ni kanjiru toki

00:00:37.451 --> 00:00:43.390
I understand the burden
inochi no omosa to

00:00:43.390 --> 00:00:50.796
And the transience of life
hakanasa wo shiru no

00:00:53.567 --> 00:00:58.605
Nights of sorrowful wandering
mayoinageku yoru mo

00:00:58.605 --> 00:01:05.479
And tearful mornings
namida no asa mo

00:01:05.479 --> 00:01:11.084
I believe in tomorrow
ashita wo shinjiru kara

00:01:11.084 --> 00:01:17.357
So I can make it through
koeteyukeru no

00:01:17.357 --> 00:01:25.787
To the continuation of the dream
yume no tsuzuki he

00:01:36.042 --> 00:01:41.002
KOKKURI ISLAND 2

00:01:42.949 --> 00:01:44.785
Don't move!

00:01:44.785 --> 00:01:48.016
Even if you come, you're
not gonna be any help!

00:01:49.389 --> 00:01:51.516
Stop following me!

00:01:52.793 --> 00:01:55.921
Someone like you isn't going
to be any help anyway!

00:01:59.933 --> 00:02:01.662
Chitto.

00:02:05.305 --> 00:02:07.674
Chitto! Chitto!

00:02:07.674 --> 00:02:11.269
Chitto! Where are you?! Chitto!

00:02:16.516 --> 00:02:18.484
Chitto!!

00:02:18.819 --> 00:02:22.084
Chitto! Are you there?!

00:02:34.201 --> 00:02:37.070
Chitto! Chitto!

00:02:37.070 --> 00:02:40.039
Chitto... Chitto!

00:02:47.247 --> 00:02:48.839
Chitto!

00:02:50.283 --> 00:02:52.274
Hey, Chi...

00:03:27.821 --> 00:03:31.086
I-It's a killer bee!

00:03:33.593 --> 00:03:35.788
Ch-Chitto!

00:03:46.806 --> 00:03:49.673
Damn it!

00:04:02.656 --> 00:04:05.989
I-It's right above Chitto.

00:04:34.421 --> 00:04:38.653
No way! No way! Absolutely no way!

00:04:54.107 --> 00:04:55.699
Chitto!

00:04:56.576 --> 00:04:58.044
Stupid! Stop!

00:04:58.044 --> 00:05:00.914
Don't move! Those are killer bees!

00:05:00.914 --> 00:05:04.315
My grandfather died after
being stung by those!

00:05:04.417 --> 00:05:08.154
If we wait a little the bees will
calm down. Don't worry, okay?

00:05:08.154 --> 00:05:10.145
He'll be fine.

00:05:19.132 --> 00:05:22.568
Hey! Didn't I tell you
not to move? Hey!

00:06:16.289 --> 00:06:18.154
Chitto!

00:06:19.492 --> 00:06:21.119
Chitto!

00:07:06.573 --> 00:07:09.542
Chitto! Chitto!

00:07:12.245 --> 00:07:16.477
Chitto. Thank goodness.
Does it hurt anywhere?

00:07:17.217 --> 00:07:19.452
Helga...

00:07:19.452 --> 00:07:23.889
Oh, that's right. I was
picking some fruit and fell.

00:07:23.990 --> 00:07:26.550
Helga, did you rescue me?

00:07:26.926 --> 00:07:28.826
Together with Thoma.

00:07:28.962 --> 00:07:30.827
Thoma?

00:07:31.030 --> 00:07:32.759
Where's Thoma?

00:07:32.832 --> 00:07:36.233
Oh, Thoma.
Thoma, thank you!

00:07:40.340 --> 00:07:42.638
Thoma, what's the matter?

00:07:45.278 --> 00:07:47.041
Thank you for this.

00:07:48.581 --> 00:07:51.951
This one! It was pretty stubborn.

00:07:51.951 --> 00:07:53.578
Just hold on.

00:07:55.989 --> 00:07:57.286
Here.

00:07:59.559 --> 00:08:01.720
-Is it good?
-Yes.

00:08:01.795 --> 00:08:04.764
That's great! Want another one?

00:08:06.132 --> 00:08:10.370
I'll give you a big one, Helga. Here!

00:08:10.370 --> 00:08:12.361
I'm gonna have some, too!

00:09:54.474 --> 00:09:57.637
Helga... Good morning.

00:09:58.645 --> 00:10:00.476
Good morning.

00:10:14.694 --> 00:10:19.961
What's with that Chitto?
Where's he gone off to?

00:10:22.468 --> 00:10:24.663
Hey, listen...

00:10:24.971 --> 00:10:27.030
Here!

00:10:27.507 --> 00:10:29.498
Clothes.

00:10:30.376 --> 00:10:32.401
Yours are all dirty, right?

00:10:36.115 --> 00:10:39.380
These are my mom's clothes.

00:10:39.619 --> 00:10:41.348
Thank you.

00:10:54.834 --> 00:10:57.302
That drawing...

00:10:58.972 --> 00:11:01.941
That's where you want to go, right?

00:11:02.742 --> 00:11:08.305
I feel like I've seen that
place somewhere before.

00:11:09.782 --> 00:11:11.918
Thoma!!

00:11:11.918 --> 00:11:15.655
Thoma! There's a weird guy over there!

00:11:15.655 --> 00:11:17.623
A weird guy?

00:11:17.724 --> 00:11:20.488
Ah! Stupid! Stop it!

00:11:20.860 --> 00:11:25.498
Woah, it's a tiger! What's with
these clothes? They're ugly!

00:11:25.498 --> 00:11:27.700
-So, where is he?
-What?

00:11:27.700 --> 00:11:29.702
You said there was a weird guy, right?

00:11:29.702 --> 00:11:32.967
-He's over by the big rocks!
-Okay!

00:11:50.089 --> 00:11:52.387
Look, he's over there.

00:12:04.804 --> 00:12:06.499
That guy...

00:12:09.609 --> 00:12:11.911
-It's him.
-You know him?

00:12:11.911 --> 00:12:15.081
Coming on my island without permission!

00:12:15.081 --> 00:12:17.183
What should we do?

00:12:17.183 --> 00:12:19.777
We're gonna catch him!

00:13:01.227 --> 00:13:03.661
B-Baron.

00:13:27.286 --> 00:13:30.221
B-Baron.

00:14:01.854 --> 00:14:03.956
What's with that guy?

00:14:03.956 --> 00:14:07.050
See, he's weird, isn't he?

00:14:31.951 --> 00:14:35.648
-What is that guy doing?
-He's suspicious.

00:14:39.192 --> 00:14:40.921
Baron...

00:14:41.561 --> 00:14:43.296
Baron.

00:14:43.296 --> 00:14:45.287
Hey! You!

00:14:50.269 --> 00:14:52.038
There was someone here?

00:14:52.038 --> 00:14:54.507
What? That's what I should be saying!

00:14:54.507 --> 00:14:57.874
Listen, this is my island!
What're you doing?!

00:14:58.611 --> 00:15:01.614
-What's with you?
-I should be saying that, too!

00:15:01.614 --> 00:15:03.316
You'd better stay away from here.

00:15:03.316 --> 00:15:05.307
This place has nothing to do with you.

00:15:05.418 --> 00:15:06.819
Why you...

00:15:06.819 --> 00:15:10.022
You can't come on my island without
permission and say whatever you want!

00:15:10.022 --> 00:15:11.857
This is not your island.

00:15:11.857 --> 00:15:15.725
This is Kokkuri Island, state-owned
land of the Eastern Mainland.

00:15:16.262 --> 00:15:18.631
Don't mess with me!

00:15:18.631 --> 00:15:20.599
Don't touch me!

00:15:22.034 --> 00:15:24.059
Just go home quietly.

00:15:24.570 --> 00:15:26.037
Thoma!

00:15:46.392 --> 00:15:49.061
You're pretty good, aren't you?

00:15:49.061 --> 00:15:52.292
But you won't get away from
my Papin fighting style.

00:15:55.067 --> 00:15:58.764
If you apologize, I'd be
willing to let you off for today.

00:15:59.639 --> 00:16:01.971
What do I have to apologize for?

00:16:02.241 --> 00:16:04.971
All I did was tell you to
stay away from here.

00:16:06.145 --> 00:16:07.908
Have it your way.

00:16:48.554 --> 00:16:51.190
You're breathing pretty hard.

00:16:51.190 --> 00:16:55.126
That's why I told you, you're
not getting away from me!

00:16:55.695 --> 00:16:58.027
It's your own fault!

00:17:02.368 --> 00:17:05.064
How's that?
Are you ready to apologize?

00:17:10.976 --> 00:17:12.603
Thoma!

00:17:12.745 --> 00:17:15.348
Don't move! It can extend further!

00:17:15.348 --> 00:17:17.339
This isn't a toy!

00:17:27.259 --> 00:17:30.695
G-Get out of here right now!

00:17:41.707 --> 00:17:45.511
You jerk! Swinging around a
sword like that is dangerous!

00:17:45.511 --> 00:17:47.480
-Thoma!
What is it?!

00:17:47.480 --> 00:17:51.041
This sword, it doesn't cut. Look.

00:17:54.019 --> 00:17:58.324
So it is a toy! Now talk!
What island did you come from?

00:17:58.324 --> 00:18:01.851
-Stop it...
-Tell me or I'll punch you again!

00:18:08.033 --> 00:18:10.661
Wonder!!

00:19:23.008 --> 00:19:25.010
Th-Thoma.

00:19:25.010 --> 00:19:28.446
Don't worry.
I just scared him a little.

00:19:29.181 --> 00:19:32.378
That's enough, Wonder.
Thank you.

00:19:35.187 --> 00:19:38.088
Let's go. This place has
been found out now.

00:19:49.902 --> 00:19:52.738
Thoma! Thoma! Hey, Thoma!

00:19:52.738 --> 00:19:55.104
Are you okay? Thoma!

00:20:09.522 --> 00:20:13.292
I see. But I'm glad you're alright.
How's Wonder?

00:20:13.292 --> 00:20:16.328
Don't worry, I've moved
her to another place.

00:20:16.328 --> 00:20:19.525
Any messages, Tarlant?
Had anything been received?

00:20:21.901 --> 00:20:25.104
Blast! Why hasn't there been any contact?

00:20:25.104 --> 00:20:27.436
Do they plan on leaving us here?!

00:20:30.109 --> 00:20:33.312
What about you? Did you find anything?

00:20:33.312 --> 00:20:35.314
Schools, orphanages...

00:20:35.314 --> 00:20:38.817
We tried all the places where an
11-year-old child might be but...

00:20:38.817 --> 00:20:41.654
Just because Serafine was
born in the South East Islands,

00:20:41.654 --> 00:20:44.248
it doesn't mean she'll be
in the same area again.

00:20:45.691 --> 00:20:47.660
Let's go back to Clairmont.

00:20:47.660 --> 00:20:50.561
Soreto and Hasmodye are
waiting at the sanatorium.

00:20:53.198 --> 00:20:57.066
EASTERN MAINLAND. NOHEDGE

00:20:58.571 --> 00:21:01.740
Detective Cooks! Are you going out?

00:21:01.740 --> 00:21:03.409
To the Western Mainland.

00:21:03.409 --> 00:21:06.312
I'm going to Clairmont, where that
fragment originally came from.

00:21:06.312 --> 00:21:08.914
-Fragment?
-Remember, I told you.

00:21:08.914 --> 00:21:11.884
That piece of black stone that
was discovered 100 years ago.

00:21:11.884 --> 00:21:13.886
Here! I did some checking.

00:21:13.886 --> 00:21:17.423
I don't think it's the same Ged Group
you told me about, Detective Cooks.

00:21:17.423 --> 00:21:20.426
But apparently there's a
university research group

00:21:20.426 --> 00:21:23.362
called Phantom Ged on the Eastern
Mainland's Ketplaque Island.

00:21:23.362 --> 00:21:25.431
This woman is the director.

00:21:25.431 --> 00:21:27.865
Gherta Hawksbee.

00:21:29.501 --> 00:21:33.072
And I received a reply about
Pilot Grass of Nohedge,

00:21:33.072 --> 00:21:38.277
he was killed in the year 2009 during
the test run of a new type of aircraft.

00:21:38.277 --> 00:21:41.413
He was buried on the
air force grounds in Hague.

00:21:41.413 --> 00:21:45.050
I guess that old man must have
been a different person then.

00:21:45.050 --> 00:21:48.110
So she's a scholar from Germany.

00:21:50.756 --> 00:21:52.891
3 days ago, there was some commotion

00:21:52.891 --> 00:21:55.494
over a capture on Chikao
of the Natsuna Islands.

00:21:55.494 --> 00:21:59.131
There was an escaped prisoner,
an old woman, over 70 years old.

00:21:59.131 --> 00:22:01.266
-An old woman?
-Yes.

00:22:01.266 --> 00:22:04.929
It seems a large, unidentified group
came in force to the island.

00:22:05.004 --> 00:22:07.606
So, did they capture her?

00:22:07.606 --> 00:22:10.131
According to what the chief told me,

00:22:10.743 --> 00:22:13.473
she died immediately upon capture.

00:22:35.401 --> 00:22:45.208
At the bottom of the deep, clear sea
fukaku fukaku sukitooru umi no soko ni

00:22:45.477 --> 00:22:55.320
A small flower is resting
chiisana hana madoronderu

00:22:55.320 --> 00:23:00.053
The melody of a gentle wind
amayaka na kaze no shirabe

00:23:00.092 --> 00:23:04.927
Passes through a rainbow
niji wo kuguri

00:23:05.330 --> 00:23:14.466
The fish are playing in the sky
sakanatachi wa sora ni asobu

00:23:14.573 --> 00:23:19.645
Everyone plays the music of love
dare mo ga ai wo kanaderu

00:23:19.645 --> 00:23:24.917
A warm light came down
atatakana hikari futteta

00:23:24.917 --> 00:23:29.320
(A gaze) That gaze
(manazashi wa) sono manazashi wa

00:23:29.354 --> 00:23:33.659
Is unbound and becomes full
hodokete michiteku

00:23:33.659 --> 00:23:38.528
Embraced by water
mizu ni dakare
